---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'


const faqSections = [
    {
        title: "The Application",
        items: [
            {
                q: "What is Socket.Kill?",
                a: "The design is optimised to produce killmails as fast as the internet allows, streamlining every aspect of the rendering process. The ideas is to see how fast it could run from the end point to the front page"
            },
            {
                q: "How is this different from zKill or Eve-Kill?",
                a: "Both contribute to historical records — stats, history, deep detailed information. Socket.Kill is a live feed focused on low latency performance, they are complementary tools, not competitors. Idea is to use both."
            },
            {
                q: "Can I filter the feed?",
                a: "Yes. Type a corp, alliance, system, or region name and the feed filters to matching kills, you can also chain those options together to create your own view."
            },
            {
                q: "What the hell is this search killmails engine",
                a: "Well I had all this data lying around, figured I would use it to extend the web site, as a result you can now chain a query together and have a look at kills since 0001 UTC"
            },
            {
                q: "What's with the green-on-black aesthetic?",
                a: "A lot of interfaces opt for utility and re-usability. I did things slightly different, fusing the alient franchise with the dark industrial feel of eve online, its not perfect but its cool"
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        title: "The Data",
        items: [
            {
                q: "Where does the data come from?",
                a: "Squizz's recently developed R2 feed from zKillboard, which is utilised by multiple EVE killmail tools. Socket.Kill renders it differently."
            },
            {
                q: "Is this open source?",
                a: "The frontend is. <a href='https://github.com/ScotDex/socketkill-v2' class='text-[var(--color-neon-green)] underline'>github.com/ScotDex/socketkill-frontend</a>. I cannot permit backend open source yet — some corporations are sensitive."
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        title: "The Developer",
        items: [
            {
                q: "Who is responsible for this witchcraft?",
                a: "In game name is Dexomus Viliana, you may see me hanging out in twitch streams called scottishdex, come say hi :) "
            },
            {
                q: "I want to say thank you, how do I do that?",
                a: "I specifically designed this server to run on a super tiny VM so running costs are minimal, plus I am incredibly lucky in my job so all of this nonsense is very free, however feel free to toss me some isk to pay for my loki losses"
            },
            {
                q: "Are you an idiot? Why would you make yet another killboard?",
                a: "Purely by chance I came up with this idea, I was creating an application for a different corporation and discarding a bunch of lossmail, subsequently wondered what was possible, one thing led to another and I ended up on the eve creator awards."
            }
        ]
    }
]

---

<Base title="About — Socket.Kill">
    <Fragment slot="head">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css" />
    </Fragment>

    <header class="text-center py-12 border-b border-white/5">
        <h1 class="text-5xl text-[var(--color-neon-green)] tracking-widest mb-4 font-mono">SOCKET.KILL</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 mb-8">See yourself die in an atmospheric and aesthetically pleasing way.</p>
        <a href="/" class="bg-[var(--color-neon-green)] text-black px-10 py-3 font-bold tracking-widest hover:bg-green-500 transition">MAIN SITE</a>

        <div class="flex gap-8 justify-center mt-10 text-2xl">
            <a href="https://twitter.com/scottishdex" title="X / Twitter" class="hover:text-[var(--color-neon-green)] transition"><i class="fa-brands fa-x-twitter"></i></a>
            <a href="https://youtube.com/@scottishdex" title="YouTube" class="hover:text-[var(--color-neon-green)] transition"><i class="fa-brands fa-youtube"></i></a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto p-6">
        {faqSections.map(section => (
            <section class="py-8">
                <h2 class="text-[var(--color-neon-green)] text-sm tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-2">{section.title}</h2>
                <div class="divide-y divide-white/10 border-y border-white/10">
                    {section.items.map(item => (
                        <details>
                            <summary class="py-5 flex justify-between items-center gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none hover:text-[var(--color-neon-green)] transition">
                                <span class="uppercase tracking-wide font-bold">{item.q}</span>
                                <span class="text-[var(--color-neon-green)] text-2xl accordion-icon"></span>
                            </summary>
                            <div class="pb-5 text-gray-400">
                                <p set:html={item.a}></p>
                            </div>
                        </details>
                    ))}
                </div>
            </section>
        ))}
    </main>

    <footer class="max-w-7xl mx-auto p-4 mt-8 border-t border-white/5 text-center">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-xs tracking-widest text-gray-500 font-mono">
            <div>
                <a href="/" class="hover:text-[var(--color-neon-green)] transition">&lt; BACK TO SOCKETKILL.COM</a>
            </div>
            <div class="space-x-4">
                <a href="https://github.com/ScotDex/socketkill-v2" target="_blank" class="hover:text-[var(--color-neon-green)]">GITHUB</a>
                <a href="https://discord.gg/dpgmEm9REc" target="_blank" class="hover:text-[var(--color-neon-green)]">DISCORD</a>
            </div>
            <div>
                &copy; 2026 SOCKETKILL.COM
            </div>
        </div>
        <div id="legal" class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 text-[0.65rem] leading-relaxed text-gray-600 font-mono text-left max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            <p class="mb-2">
                EVE Online and the EVE logo are registered trademarks of Fenris Creations. All rights are reserved worldwide.
                All other trademarks are the property of their respective owners. FC has granted permission to socketkill.com
                to use EVE Online and all associated logos and designs for promotional and informational purposes on its
                website but does not endorse, and is not in any way affiliated with, socketkill.com. FC is in no way
                responsible for the content on or functioning of this website, nor can it be liable for any damage arising
                from the use of this website.
            </p>
            <p>
                Background art by <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/rixxjavix/albums/72157651335101023" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[var(--color-neon-green)]/60 hover:text-[var(--color-neon-green)]">Rixx Javix</a>
                and <a href="https://www.lloydgeorge.art/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[var(--color-neon-green)]/60 hover:text-[var(--color-neon-green)]">El Geo</a>.
                Kill data via <a href="https://github.com/zKillboard/zKillboard/wiki/API-(R2Z2)" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[var(--color-neon-green)]/60 hover:text-[var(--color-neon-green)]">zKillboard</a>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</Base>

<style>
    details summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    details:not([open]) .accordion-icon::before { content: '+'; }
    details[open] .accordion-icon::before { content: '−'; }
</style>